    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNestled in the picturesque seaside town of Rush, this spectacular four-bedroom, three-story family home offers the perfect blend of contemporary elegance and coastal charm. Finished to an wonderful standard throughout, this modern residence provides a unique opportunity to acquire a luxurious, turnkey home situated just minutes from pristine sandy beaches, the scenic harbour, local shops, excellent schools, and a wide array of village amenities.\n\nEvery detail of this property has been thoughtfully designed with the modern family in mind. Boasting extra features and finishes, the home is ideally positioned within this highly popular development to overlook a peaceful open green to the front, while benefiting from beautiful, refreshing sea views from the front.\n\nThe bright and well-proportioned living accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious and light-filled living room, and an impressive open-plan kitchen and dining area designed for modern living. On the first floor, there are three generously sized bedrooms and a contemporary family bathroom. The top floor is dedicated entirely to the luxurious primary bedroom suite, a private sanctuary boasting a spacious walk-in wardrobe area and a stylish en-suite bathroom.\n\nThe rear garden is a beautifully landscaped, an oasis of peace and tranquility, cleverly designed to create a completely private outdoor haven. A bright, paved patio area paired with elegant raised bedding offers the perfect setting for al fresco dining, summer entertaining, or simply relaxing after a busy day.\n\nRush is a thriving coastal community situated adjacent to Skerries and Lusk, offering an unbeatable lifestyle. The town boasts an excellent selection of schools, shops, award-winning restaurants, pubs, and two beautiful beaches, with the celebrated Millbank Theatre also located within easy reach of your front door. For commuters, the area is exceptionally well-serviced by a regular and frequent express bus service to Dublin City Centre, while the commuter train station is just a five-minute drive away, placing Dublin Airport and the M1/M50 network within easy commuting distance."
      },
      {
